  "title": "Methanex Launches Global Methanol Bunkering Operations with Strategic Partnerships in the ARA Region and South Korea - Methanex",
  "summary": "VANCOUVER, British Columbia, Sept. 23, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Methanex Corporation (TSX:MX) (Nasdaq:MEOH), the world’s largest producer and supplier of methanol, today announced new strategic partnerships in two of the world’s key fueling hubs—the ARA (Amsterdam-Rotterdam-Antwerp) region and South Korea. These agreements further advance Methanex’s leadership role in supporting the marine energy transition. In the […]",
